(property "Description" "Commercial module, functional named GPIO/power pads. Factory LDO, 12MHz oscillator, flash, bypass capacitors and GPIO29 RGB LED remain onboard; no invented numeric cable contacts. | module | Design assignment: UART0 GP0 TX / GP1 RX; SPI0 GP2 SCK, GP3 MOSI, GP4 MISO, GP5 CS; GP6 BNO interrupt, GP7 reset, GP8 PS0/WAKE. SPI 1MHz MODE3; core 125MHz; UART115200 CRC frames.; GPIO9-28 pads unused; GPIO29 belongs to the onboard RGB LED. E5 owns GX16-4, supply Schottky and ESD at both ends. Connect no USB during deployed operation.; The named-pad interface is physically identified by Waveshare schematic; actual pad orientation and assembled harness continuity must be checked before power." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
