(text "E3-05 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.2 (MCP23017 #3/#4)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 123.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8dd7407e-30d5-567b-9208-d73a89a74d4e))
(text "Shared MCP interrupt requires open-drain configuration before interrupts are enabled, plus measured I2C rise\ntime and VOL.\nВорота (стенд): Set ODR=1 and MIRROR=1 first. Validate 100kHz, rise <=1000ns, 1e6 reads under load, 20 cold/20\nwarm boots, and 10us FAULT capture." (at 13.97 125.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid d623ec5b-b298-5315-aa64-e7c48ce03223))
