(text "E3-01 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §2.8; §5.2; §8 (пак IMU); §8.1 (пак IMU)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 334.01 242.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ec8745e6-3555-5d01-afe6-d574c0af2419))
(text "IMU assembly and two metre single-ended UART need bench verification. Internal named-pad wiring is specified,\nbut no physical harness has been measured.\nВорота (стенд): Check actual module revision, GX16 plug/socket viewing direction and continuity to E5 design\npinout; validate input Schottky and TVS at both ends; 1e6 frames with zero CRC errors. Upgrade to differential\ninterface if errors occur." (at 334.01 244.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9e60d583-e213-5c31-8089-264382e539ba))
