(text "E3-08 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.2; §5.4" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 407.67 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9cf37bd2-45da-5421-9412-6ce5a85d61f1))
(text "Pico watchdog, MicroPython GPIO/UART adapter and host handshake implemented 20.10.2026 and tested on the host.\nActual GPIO timing, reset levels, WDT/brownout behavior and Linux/serial fault recovery have not been\nqualified on the device.\nВорота (стенд): Run the implemented firmware with the actual accepted Pico/Q6A assembly: scope MCP RESET\nassertion/release, safe output image including CHG_INHIBIT=1 after initialization, 100ms guard, 750ms\nheartbeat deadline plus measured latency, explicit fresh-session recovery, Linux kill/hang, UART\nloss/corruption, WDT/brownout and GPIO current/backfeed. Complete Pico power loss with Q6A alive remains\noutside Q306 coverage; no software test closes this boundary." (at 407.67 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fac5adcb-a987-500f-8eb5-df459840445f))
