(text "BOM candidate Semiware MF52A103F3950 is selected for both NTCs; purchased-lot curve, attachment, lag and\ninstalled calibration remain unqualified.\nВорота (стенд): Verify 10k +/-1% at 25 C and manufacturer B25/50 = 3950 +/-1%; use the exact maker R/T table.\nFit an insulated bead/strain relief on the panel spreader and frame, check 25/60/68 C against a reference\nthermometer, qualify lag and open/short/stale fail-safe behavior. Remain inside the -20..120 C sensor range." (at 407.67 145.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e2d7323e-d42b-5633-aaf9-dd427fed91b3))
